Package: cubcoclust
Type: Package
Title: Co-Clustering of Ordinal Data with a Latent Block Model and CUB Distributions
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Prénom NOM, Prénom NOM
Maintainer: Prénom NOM <adresse@univ-lyon2.fr>
Description: Co-clustering of ordinal data with a latent block model in which the
    ratings of each block follow a CUB distribution. Parameters are estimated by
    a SEM-Gibbs algorithm and the numbers of row and column clusters are
    compared with the ICL criterion.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
